# Allow-list: nothing is in the build context unless it is re-included below. Tests, tools, run outputs, local caches and anything else stay out of the image.
*
!requirements-*.lock
!configs/
!configs/**
!model/
!model/**
!artifacts/
!artifacts/*.whl
!meralion_worker/
!meralion_worker/**
!patches/
!patches/manifest.json
!patches/*.patch
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
model/.cache
model/**/.cache
